WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Initializing vessel tracking system and zooming
into the port area for detailed monitoring.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Verifying cargo manifest and checking Remaining
On Board (ROB) quantities prior to departure.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Commencing sailing operations and zooming out
to visualize transit route across Persian Gulf.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Navigating Sharjah Port: approaching anchorage,
berthing, cargo handling, and final departure.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Real-time status visualization: white markers
indicate stationary vessels; speed via gradients.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Executing arrival and tie-up at Rig #1, followed
by dynamic repositioning to Rig #2.

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Returning to Kish Island; adaptive speed adjustment
near Lavan due to maritime traffic density.